# Keys that sign EDLD release manifests, in OpenSSH allowed_signers format.
#
#   ssh-keygen -Y verify -f signing/allowed_signers -I indevlin-vcs@indevlin.com \
#       -n edld.release -s EDLD-<version>.sha256.sig < EDLD-<version>.sha256
#
# The principal is a label, not a mailbox that is checked: a signature names a
# key and a namespace, never a person, so relabelling a key changes nothing
# about what it has already signed. A retired key stays listed here for as
# long as releases it signed are on the releases page; the key that signs new
# releases is also signing/id_ed25519_signing.pub. See docs/SIGNING.md.
